'''Fragments''' (informally known as Frags) are a type of [[currency]] used in the [[Second Sea]] and [[Third Sea]]. 

Fragments are one of the three primary currencies in the game, the others being [[Money]] and [[Valor]]. It has many uses. For example: unlocking the special or the more unique [[items]] in the game, or awakening fruits. They are also considerably more difficult to obtain, being dropped in smaller amounts and usually requiring special effort, separate from normal grinding, to gain a large amount.

The {{Fragment}} symbol is a <u>[https://home.unicode.org/ unicode]</u> character named "''Latin Small Letter F with Hook''" ( '''''ƒ''''' ), its code is <code>U+0192</code>.

