==Purposes==
Fragments can be used to:
* Obtain [[Items]]
* Unlock [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]]
* [[Raids|Awaken]] [[Blox Fruits]]
* [[Change Race|Change]] [[races]]
* [[Stat Reset|Reset]] [[stats]]
* Unlock [[Crew]] slots
* Upgrade [[Race Awakening]]
* Bribe the [[Spy]]
* Obtain [[Skins]]
* Getting [[Aura/Skins|Aura colours]]

==Trivia==
* On console, the player will still be able to see how many fragments they have even if they haven't entered [[Second Sea]].
* To see how much Fragments the player has, they need to hover their cursor over the [[Money]] value on PC. On console and mobile, it always displays.
* The [[Rare Artifact]] used to fulfill some of the purposes of this [[currency]], but it was then removed in [[Updates/11|Update 11]].
* Before [[Updates/20|Update 20]], this currency didn't appear when the player was in the [[First Sea]].
* There are a few non renewable ways to obtain fragments, like the Horned Man's Quest, which gives an increasing amount of fragments for each boss killed, cumulating to {{Fragment|1,500}} in total.
* The maximum amount of Fragments a player can hold is {{Fragment|1,000,000,000}}.
* It costs {{Fragment|686,950}} to fully max everything the player can buy with [[Fragments]] (excluding [[Tort|Race Reroll]] and [[Stat Reset]])
** {{Fragment|172,800}} to fully [[Raids|Awaken]] all [[Blox Fruits|fruits]]
** {{Fragment|187,250}} to fully awaken [[Race Awakening|V4]] on every [[Races|race]]
** {{Fragment|2,500}} to buy the [[Cyborg/Puzzle|Cyborg]] race for the first time (excluding potential re-purchases)
** {{Fragment|31,500}} to unlock all [[Fighting Styles]]
** {{Fragment|30,000}} to unlock all [[crew]] slots
** {{Fragment|1,500}} to purchase the [[Lantern]] boat from [[Cyborg (MISC)|Cyborg]]
** {{Fragment|1,500}} to get [[Kabucha]]
** {{Fragment|37,500}} to get all [[Aura]] colors from [[Barista]]
** {{Fragment|91,000}} to get all [[Dragon]] [[skins]] from [[Barista]] (both East and West variants)
** {{Fragment|10,000}} to get the 2 [[Dragon]] seats ({{Fragment|5,000}} each from the [[Dragon Tamer]])
** {{Fragment|15,800}} to max the [[Shipwright]] subclass
** {{Fragment|74,600}} to upgrade [[Gravity]], [[Eagle]], [[Pain]], [[Control]] and [[Lightning]] fruits in the [[Admin Panel]]
** {{Fragment|9,500}} to get all [[Eagle]] [[skins]] from [[Barista]]
** {{Fragment|5,500}} to get the 2 [[titles]] "The Grandfather" and "Jack of All Trades" ([[Change Race|Race Reroll]] and [[Stat Reset|Stats Refund]])
** {{Fragment|10,000}} to fully upgrade [[Sharkman Karate]] to V3
** {{Fragment|6,000}} to obtain [[Shark Rod]], [[Shell Rod]], and [[Treasure Rod]]

* Players are able to obtain [[Fragments]] in the [[First Sea]] by buying them from "[[Greedy Elf]]" for 50 and 100 [[Candy|Candies]] for 100 and 500 [[Fragments]] respectively only during the [[Christmas Event]].

